      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Incident handoff\n- Environment (context): **$environment**\n- Namespace: **$namespace**\n- Service: **$service**\n- Scenario (context): **$scenario**\n- This dashboard surfaces Kubernetes and app telemetry for operator review.\n- Requests/errors and dependency-failure panels use Azure Monitor / Log Analytics data when available; otherwise they remain empty rather than implying healthy zeros.\n- The service selector uses the repo-owned service prefix values, and the Azure Monitor queries use prefix matching for the selected service.\n- Use the links above for the runbook, safe-language guardrails, and the portal handoff.",
